v>","info":{"doc":"Identity simproc (no simplification).","docLink":"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.none","kind":"def","line":76,"name":"Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.none","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.lean#L76-L77"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.self\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">self</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Recursive simplification (calls the full simplifier).","docLink":"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.self","kind":"def","line":73,"name":"Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.self","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.lean#L73-L74"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.arith\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">arith</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalize ring and semiring terms into polynomial normal form (`Sym.Arith.normalize?`).\nSimplifies the atoms recursively. Intended as a `pre` simproc. The optional discharger proves\nthe side conditions `x ≠ 0` under which `x * x⁻¹` is cancelled in a field.","docLink":"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.arith","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.arith","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.lean#L68-L71"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteInline\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">rewriteInline</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Rewrite using inline theorems. Optionally specify a discharger for conditional rewrites.","docLink":"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteInline","kind":"def","line":65,"name":"Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteInline","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.lean#L65-L66"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteSet\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">rewriteSet</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Rewrite using a named theorem set. Optionally specify a discharger for conditional rewrites.","docLink":"./Init/Sym/Simp/SimprocDSL.html#Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteSet","kind":"def","line":62,"name":"Lean.Parser.Sym.Simp.rewriteSet","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f